- id: using-merge-modes
  title: Combining Pattern Overlaps
  audience: all
  summary: Trig, note, velocity and length merge choices are independent.
  prose: '1. Assign two patterns to a channel.

    2. Open Channel tasks → Merge modes.

    3. Select the trig merge field with E2.

    4. Change the mode with E3 and compare playback.

    5. Repeat for note, velocity and length merge fields.


    The default Skip trig mode removes overlapping attacks. All retains attacks from either pattern. If
    an attack disappears after assigning another pattern, check the trig merge mode.'
  musical_use: Combine a steady pulse and a syncopated pattern. Compare Skip with All while keeping the
    output sound unchanged.
