- id: melody-composition
  title: Entering a Melody
  audience: all
  summary: Use note masks to replace selected channel pitches.
  prose: '1. Select the destination channel.

    2. Open Channel tasks → Masks.

    3. Select Note with E2.

    4. Hold the destination step and turn E3 to change its note.

    5. Release the step and start playback to check the phrase.


    Without a held step, E3 changes the channel default. A held step can also receive a note or chord
    from MIDI input; set its length manually. For live entry, arm Record `(2,8)` and play during playback.'
